  normalizing transport line endings, without changing their reviewed text.
- 2026-11-10: Downloaded the actual hosted assets, verified all 450 files
  and installed a new version directory without replacing older binaries.
  All eight frozen offline checks and the exact installed version passed.
  Rechecked the source launcher, selected private/native metadata, media,
  older release assets/tags and installed entrypoints without live actions.
